{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.KnillLaflammeRecovery.finite_error_set_recovery\",\"type\":\"∀ {I : Type u_1} {H : Type u_2} {L : Type u_3} [inst : Fintype I] [inst_1 : Fintype H] [inst_2 : Fintype L]\\n  [DecidableEq I] [inst_4 : DecidableEq H] [inst_5 : DecidableEq L] [Nonempty L] (V : Matrix H L ℂ),\\n  V.conjTranspose * V = 1 →\\n    ∀ (E : I → Matrix H H ℂ),\\n      MainTheory.FiniteKrausChannel.KnillLaflamme V E →\\n        ∃ R,\\n          MainTheory.FiniteKrausChannel.TracePreserving R ∧\\n            ∀ (m : ℕ) (a : Fin m → I → ℂ),\\n              (MainTheory.FiniteKrausChannel.TracePreserving fun t => ∑ i, a t i • E i) →\\n                MainTheory.FiniteKrausChannel.Recovers V (fun t => ∑ i, a t i • E i) R\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":825},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":792},"severity":"information"}
