{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.NegativePhaseEquations.four_binomial\",\"type\":\"∀ (r a b c d u v w x : ℂ),\\n  r ≠ 0 →\\n    u = -r * Star.star a →\\n      v = -r * Star.star b →\\n        w = -r * Star.star c →\\n          x = -r * Star.star d →\\n            Star.star a * v + Star.star c * x + Star.star d * w + Star.star b * u = 0 → a * b + c * d = 0\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":859},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":826},"severity":"information"}
