{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.Orbit26.D3_not_isUnit\",\"type\":\"∀ {C D : Fin 3 → MainTheory.Orbit26.M2} {C3 D3 : MainTheory.Orbit26.M2},\\n  (∀ (g : Fin 3), Matrix.conjTranspose C3 * D g + (Matrix.conjTranspose (C g) * D3).transpose = 0) →\\n    (∀ (g h : Fin 3),\\n        g ≠ h →\\n          MainTheory.Orbit26.cj (C g) * MainTheory.Orbit26.Jmat * Matrix.transpose (D h) +\\n              MainTheory.Orbit26.cj (C h) * MainTheory.Orbit26.Jmat * Matrix.transpose (D g) =\\n            0) →\\n      ∑ g, D g * Matrix.conjTranspose (D g) = D3 * Matrix.conjTranspose D3 + 2 • (C3 * Matrix.conjTranspose C3) →\\n        (∀ (g : Fin 3), D g ≠ 0) →\\n          (∃ g, ¬(D g 0 0 = 0 ∧ D g 1 0 = 0) ∧ ¬(D g 0 1 = 0 ∧ D g 1 1 = 0)) →\\n            (¬IsUnit (Matrix.det C3) →\\n                ∃ d,\\n                  ∑ i, Complex.normSq (d i) = 1 ∧\\n                    C3 * Matrix.conjTranspose C3 = (1 / 4) • Matrix.vecMulVec d (Star.star d)) →\\n              (∀ (w : Fin 2 → ℂ),\\n                  ∑ i, Complex.normSq (w i) = 1 →\\n                    ∀ (g : Fin 3),\\n                      Complex.normSq (Matrix.vecMul w (MainTheory.Orbit26.cj (D g)) 0) +\\n                          Complex.normSq (Matrix.vecMul w (MainTheory.Orbit26.cj (D g)) 1) ≤\\n                        1 / 4) →\\n                (∀ (w : Fin 2 → ℂ),\\n                    ∑ i, Complex.normSq (w i) = 1 →\\n                      ∀ (j : Fin 2),\\n                        Complex.normSq (Matrix.vecMul w (MainTheory.Orbit26.cj (D 0)) j) +\\n                              Complex.normSq (Matrix.vecMul w (MainTheory.Orbit26.cj (D 1)) j) +\\n                            Complex.normSq (Matrix.vecMul w (MainTheory.Orbit26.cj (D 2)) j) ≤\\n                          3 / 8) →\\n                  ¬IsUnit (Matrix.det D3)\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":927},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullR