{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.Orbit26.F_mulVec_eq_zero_of_rankOne\",\"type\":\"∀ {A B C3 D3 : MainTheory.Orbit26.M2} {d : Fin 2 → ℂ},\\n  IsUnit (Matrix.det C3) →\\n    d ≠ 0 →\\n      D3 * Matrix.conjTranspose D3 = (1 / 4) • Matrix.vecMulVec d (Star.star d) →\\n        MainTheory.Orbit26.Fmat A B * ((Matrix.conjTranspose C3)⁻¹ * Matrix.transpose D3).transpose = 0 →\\n          Matrix.mulVec (MainTheory.Orbit26.Fmat A B) d = 0\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":927},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":894},"severity":"information"}
