{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.Orbit36MomentNormalForm.balance_equations\",\"type\":\"∀ (p : Fin 12 ⊕ Fin 12 → ℝ),\\n  MainTheory.Orbit36MomentLP.Feasible p →\\n    p (Sum.inl 1) + MainTheory.Orbit36MomentNormalForm.vertexMass p = 1 / 2 ∧\\n      p (Sum.inl 1) + MainTheory.Orbit36MomentNormalForm.edgeMass p = 1 / 2 ∧\\n        (∀ (i : Fin 4),\\n            MainTheory.Orbit36MomentNormalForm.vertexMass p - MainTheory.Orbit36MomentNormalForm.vertexProbability p i +\\n                MainTheory.Orbit36MomentNormalForm.degree p i =\\n              1 / 2) ∧\\n          p (Sum.inl 0) + p (Sum.inl 1) + MainTheory.Orbit36MomentNormalForm.vertexMass p +\\n              MainTheory.Orbit36MomentNormalForm.edgeMass p =\\n            1\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1131},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1098},"severity":"information"}
