{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.Orbit3CategoryBridge.physical_pairing_sum\",\"type\":\"∀ (P : SS.PauliString 6) (a : Fin 2) (e : Fin 21),\\n  (∑ E,\\n      if MainTheory.PhysicalPauliCategories.category E = (↑a, MainTheory.Orbit3CategoryBridge.tailCategories e) then\\n        SS.ShadowTwisted.pairSign E P\\n      else 0) =\\n    ↑(MainTheory.PhysicalPauliCategories.spectatorFactor (MainTheory.PhysicalPauliCategories.word P 0) ↑a) *\\n      ↑(MainTheory.Orbit3CategoryBridge.tailCoefficients\\n          (MainTheory.Orbit3CategoryBridge.tailIndex (Fin.tail (MainTheory.PhysicalPauliCategories.word P))) e)\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1131},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1098},"severity":"information"}
