{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.Orbit45PrintedAlgebra.diagonal_sum\",\"type\":\"∀ (b c s : ℝ),\\n  b + c + s = 1 / 4 →\\n    2 * (4 * c - 1 / 2) ^ 2 + 2 * (1 / 2 - 4 * s) ^ 2 + 2 * (1 / 2 - 4 * b) ^ 2 + (-4 * b) ^ 2 + (-4 * s) ^ 2 +\\n        (4 * c) ^ 2 =\\n      48 * MainTheory.Orbit45TrianglePolynomial.R b c s - 1 / 2\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1233},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1200},"severity":"information"}
