{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.Orbit45PrintedAlgebra.off_diagonal_sum\",\"type\":\"∀ (b c s : ℝ) (xi eta : ℂ),\\n  Complex.normSq xi = 1 →\\n    Complex.normSq eta = 1 →\\n      ↑b * xi + ↑c * eta + ↑s = 0 →\\n        b + c + s = 1 / 4 →\\n          8 * (b * s * Complex.normSq (1 + xi) + b * c * Complex.normSq (xi + eta) + c * s * Complex.normSq (1 + eta)) =\\n            1 / 2 - 16 * MainTheory.Orbit45TrianglePolynomial.R b c s\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1233},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1200},"severity":"information"}
