{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.Orbit45PrintedAlgebra.triangle_identity\",\"type\":\"∀ (b c s : ℝ) (xi eta : ℂ),\\n  Complex.normSq xi = 1 →\\n    Complex.normSq eta = 1 →\\n      ↑b * xi + ↑c * eta + ↑s = 0 →\\n        b * s * Complex.normSq (1 + xi) = c ^ 2 - (b - s) ^ 2 ∧\\n          b * c * Complex.normSq (xi + eta) = s ^ 2 - (b - c) ^ 2 ∧\\n            c * s * Complex.normSq (1 + eta) = b ^ 2 - (c - s) ^ 2\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1233},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1200},"severity":"information"}
