{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.Orbit7AlphaIdentity.A1_purity\",\"type\":\"∀ (c d : SS.State 6 ℂ),\\n  (∀ (x : SS.BitString 6), SS.weight SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.uniformAv x ≠ 0 → c x = 0) →\\n    (∀ (x : SS.BitString 6), SS.weight SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.uniformAv x ≠ 2 → d x = 0) →\\n      SS.innerC c c = 1 →\\n        SS.innerC d d = 1 →\\n          SS.HasDistance ![c, d] 3 →\\n            ↑(MainTheory.Orbit7EnumeratorDisplays.normalizedA ![c, d] 1) =\\n              2 *\\n                  (MainTheory.Orbit7ZeroQubitMarginal.zeroMarginal ![c, d] *\\n                      MainTheory.Orbit7ZeroQubitMarginal.zeroMarginal ![c, d]).trace -\\n                1\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1335},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1302},"severity":"information"}
{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.Orbit7AlphaIdentity.normalized_alpha\",\"type\":\"∀ (c d : SS.State 6 ℂ),\\n  (∀ (x : SS.BitString 6), SS.weight SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.uniformAv x ≠ 0 → c x = 0) →\\n    (∀ (x : SS.BitString 6), SS.weight SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.uniformAv x ≠ 2 → d x = 0) →\\n      SS.innerC c c = 1 →\\n        SS.innerC d d = 1 →\\n          SS.HasDistance ![c, d] 3 →\\n            ∀ (a b : ℝ),\\n              a ^ 2 + b ^ 2 = 1 →\\n                MainTheory.Orbit7MatrixDisplays.Pu c = SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.outer ![1, 0] →\\n                  MainTheory.Orbit7MatrixDisplays.Pv d =\\n                      SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.outer (MainTheory.Orbit7SpinorCoordinates.nvec a b) →\\n                    MainTheory.Orbit7EnumeratorDisplays.normalizedA ![c, d] 1 = a ^ 2\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1335},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1302},"severity":"information"}
{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.Orbit7AnchorNormalization.anchor_normal_form\",\"type\":\"∀ (c d : SS.State 6 ℂ),\\n  SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.uMass c = 1 / 6 →\\n    SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.vMass d = 1 / 6 →\\n      ∃ T lambda alpha,\\n        T * Matrix.conjTranspose T = 1 ∧\\n          Matrix.conjTranspose T * T = 1 ∧\\n            Complex.normSq lambda = 1 ∧\\n              0 ≤ alpha ∧\\n                alpha ≤ 1 ∧\\n                  (fun i => lambda * Matrix.mulVec T (SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.uSpin c) i) = ![1 / ↑√6, 0] ∧\\n                    Matrix.mulVec T (SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.vSpin d) = ![↑alpha / ↑√6, ↑√(1 - alpha ^ 2) / ↑√6]\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1335},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1302},"severity":"information"}
{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.Orbit7BoundaryDisplays.frame_projectors\",\"type\":\"∀ (C D : SS.State 6 ℂ),\\n  (∀ (i j : Fin 2),\\n      SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.sumA C i j =\\n        2 * SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.U C i j + 3 * SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.W D i j) →\\n    SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.sumA C =\\n      (1 / 3) • MainTheory.Orbit7MatrixDisplays.Pu C + (1 / 2) • MainTheory.Orbit7MatrixDisplays.Pv D\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1335},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1302},"severity":"information"}
{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.Orbit7BoundaryDisplays.isolated_expectation\",\"type\":\"∀ (c d : ℝ),\\n  c ^ 2 + d ^ 2 = 1 →\\n    SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.matEval (MainTheory.Orbit7SpinorCoordinates.mvec c d)\\n        ((1 / 3) • SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.outer ![1, 0] +\\n            (1 / 2) • SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.outer (MainTheory.Orbit7SpinorCoordinates.nvec c d) -\\n          (1 / 3) • SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.outer (MainTheory.Orbit7SpinorCoordinates.mvec c d))\\n        (MainTheory.Orbit7SpinorCoordinates.mvec c d) =\\n      ↑(-c ^ 2 / 3)\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1335},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1302},"severity":"information"}
{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.Orbit7BoundaryDisplays.isolated_negative\",\"type\":\"∀ (c d : ℝ),\\n  c ^ 2 + d ^ 2 = 1 →\\n    0 < c → 1 / 3 * Complex.normSq (MainTheory.Orbit7SpinorCoordinates.mvec c d 0) - 1 / 3 = -c ^ 2 / 3 ∧ -c ^ 2 / 3 < 0\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1335},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1302},"severity":"information"}
{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.Orbit7BoundaryDisplays.isolated_remainder\",\"type\":\"∀ (C D : SS.State 6 ℂ) (s : Fin 5) (Pm : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℂ),\\n  (∀ (i j : Fin 2),\\n      SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.sumA C i j =\\n        2 * SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.U C i j + 3 * SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.W D i j) →\\n    SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.starA C s = (1 / 3) • Pm →\\n      (fun i j => ∑ e ∈ SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.nonincidentPairs s, SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.AMat C e i j) =\\n        (1 / 3) • MainTheory.Orbit7MatrixDisplays.Pu C + (1 / 2) • MainTheory.Orbit7MatrixDisplays.Pv D - (1 / 3) • Pm\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1335},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1302},"severity":"information"}
{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.Orbit7BoundaryDisplays.outer_scalar_sum\",\"type\":\"∀ {E : Type u_1} [DecidableEq E] (F : Finset E) (y : E → ℂ) (m : SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.Spinor),\\n  ∑ e ∈ F, Complex.normSq (y e) = 1 / 3 →\\n    (fun i j => ∑ e ∈ F, SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.outer (fun k => y e * m k) i j) =\\n      (1 / 3) • SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.outer m\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1335},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1302},"severity":"information"}
{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.Orbit7BoundaryDisplays.support_graph_classification\",\"type\":\"∀ (x : Fin 5 × Fin 5 → ℂ),\\n  (∀ (i : Fin 5), SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.Hafnian5 x i = 0) →\\n    ¬SixQubit.Orbit7Mask.Isolated (SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.supportMask x) →\\n      ∃ k p,\\n        ∀ (i j : Fin 5),\\n          SixQubit.Orbit7Mask.edge (SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.supportMask x) i j =\\n            SixQubit.Orbit7Mask.edge (MainTheory.Orbit7SixGraphs.templates k) (p i) (p j)\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1369},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1336},"severity":"information"}
{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.Orbit7BoundaryMass.xmass\",\"type\":\"∀ {E : Type u_1} [DecidableEq E] (F : Finset E) (a : E → SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.Spinor) (c d : ℝ),\\n  c ^ 2 + d ^ 2 = 1 →\\n    (fun i j => ∑ e ∈ F, SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.outer (a e) i j) =\\n        (1 / 3) • SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.outer ![1, 0] +\\n          (1 / 2) • SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.outer (MainTheory.Orbit7SpinorCoordinates.nvec c d) →\\n      ∑ e ∈ F, Complex.normSq (SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.spinInner (MainTheory.Orbit7SpinorCoordinates.nvec c d) (a e)) =\\n          (3 + 2 * c ^ 2) / 6 ∧\\n        1 / 2 ≤ (3 + 2 * c ^ 2) / 6\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1369},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1336},"severity":"information"}
{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.Orbit7CircleDisplays.circle_parametrization\",\"type\":\"∀ (c d : ℝ) (t : ℂ),\\n  c ≠ 0 → d ≠ 0 → c * Complex.normSq t + d * t.re = 0 → ∃ zeta, ‖zeta‖ = 1 ∧ t = ↑(d / (2 * c)) * (zeta - 1)\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1369},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1336},"severity":"information"}
{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.Orbit7CircleDisplays.three_cases\",\"type\":\"∀ (c d : ℝ) (T N : ℂ),\\n  c ≠ 0 →\\n    d ≠ 0 →\\n      2 * ↑c * (T * Star.star T) + ↑d * (T + Star.star T) = 0 →\\n        2 * ↑c * (N * Star.star N) + ↑d * (N + Star.star N) = 0 →\\n          ↑d * (T - N + Star.star N - Star.star T) + ↑c * (T * Star.star N - N * Star.star T) = 0 →\\n            T = N ∨ T = -↑d / ↑c ∨ N = -↑d / ↑c\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1369},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1336},"severity":"information"}
{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.Orbit7CircleDisplays.zeta_factor\",\"type\":\"∀ (c d : ℝ) (T N : ℂ),\\n  d ≠ 0 →\\n    2 * ↑c * (T * Star.star T) + ↑d * (T + Star.star T) = 0 →\\n      2 * ↑c * (N * Star.star N) + ↑d * (N + Star.star N) = 0 →\\n        ↑d * (T - N + Star.star N - Star.star T) + ↑c * (T * Star.star N - N * Star.star T) = 0 →\\n          (MainTheory.Orbit7CircleDisplays.phase c d T + 1) *\\n                (MainTheory.Orbit7CircleDisplays.phase c d T - MainTheory.Orbit7CircleDisplays.phase c d N) *\\n              (MainTheory.Orbit7CircleDisplays.phase c d N + 1) =\\n            0\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1369},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1336},"severity":"information"}
{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.Orbit7EndpointDisplays.bad_star_expectation\",\"type\":\"∀ (c d : ℝ),\\n  SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.matEval (MainTheory.Orbit7SpinorCoordinates.mvec c d)\\n      ((1 / 2) • SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.outer (MainTheory.Orbit7SpinorCoordinates.nvec c d) -\\n        (1 / 6) • SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.outer ![1, 0])\\n      (MainTheory.Orbit7SpinorCoordinates.mvec c d) =\\n    ↑(-d ^ 2 / 6)\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1369},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1336},"severity":"information"}
