{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.Orbit7Jacobian.two_tangents\",\"type\":\"∀ (x y z : Fin 5 × Fin 5 → ℂ),\\n  SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.FullEdgeSupport x →\\n    (∀ (i : Fin 5), SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.Hafnian5 x i = 0) →\\n      (∀ (i : Fin 5), SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.PolarHafnian5 x y i = 0) →\\n        (∀ (i : Fin 5), SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.PolarHafnian5 x z i = 0) →\\n          ∃ r q, ∀ e ∈ SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.edgePairs, y e = (r e.1 + r e.2) * x e ∧ z e = (q e.1 + q e.2) * x e\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1369},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1336},"severity":"information"}
