{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.Orbit7NormalizedFamily.normalized_family\",\"type\":\"∀ {E : Type u_1} [DecidableEq E] (F : Finset E) (x : E → ℂ) (c d : ℝ) (t p : ℂ) (w : ℝ),\\n  c ^ 2 + d ^ 2 = 1 →\\n    Complex.normSq p = Complex.normSq t →\\n      w ≠ 0 →\\n        ∑ e ∈ F, ∑ i, Complex.normSq (MainTheory.Orbit7SpinorCoordinates.avec c d (x e) (t * x e) i) = w →\\n          ((fun i j =>\\n                  ∑ e ∈ F,\\n                    SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.outer (MainTheory.Orbit7SpinorCoordinates.avec c d (x e) (t * x e)) i j) +\\n                fun i j =>\\n                ∑ e ∈ F, SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.outer (MainTheory.Orbit7FourHafnians.bvec (x e) (p * x e)) i j) =\\n              ↑w •\\n                (SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.outer ![1, 0] +\\n                  SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.outer (MainTheory.Orbit7SpinorCoordinates.nvec c d)) →\\n            MainTheory.Orbit7NormalizedProjectors.Pa c d t + MainTheory.Orbit7NormalizedProjectors.Pb p =\\n              SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.outer ![1, 0] +\\n                SixQubit.Orbit7Universal.outer (MainTheory.Orbit7SpinorCoordinates.nvec c d)\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1369},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1336},"severity":"information"}
