{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.Orbit9TwoSupportEta.eta_equation\",\"type\":\"∀ (c d : SS.State 6 ℂ),\\n  SixQubit.Orbit9Universal.FullKL c d →\\n    ∀ (a b : Fin 6),\\n      SixQubit.Orbit9Universal.TwoSupportAt c a b →\\n        ∀ (z : ℝ),\\n          z ≠ 0 →\\n            SixQubit.Orbit9Universal.xamp c a = ↑z →\\n              SixQubit.Orbit9Universal.xamp c b = ↑z →\\n                SixQubit.Orbit9Universal.rho c d a = 1 →\\n                  ∀ (eta : ℂ),\\n                    SixQubit.Orbit9Universal.rho c d b = eta →\\n                      ∀ (t u : Fin 6),\\n                        t ≠ a →\\n                          t ≠ b →\\n                            u ≠ a →\\n                              u ≠ b →\\n                                t ≠ u →\\n                                  -2 * (1 + Star.star eta) * Star.star (SixQubit.Orbit9Universal.damp c a t) *\\n                                      Star.star (SixQubit.Orbit9Universal.damp c a u) =\\n                                    0\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1539},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1506},"severity":"information"}
