{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.OrderFiveEnumerator.m5_unique_unconditional_full\",\"type\":\"∀ (C : MainTheory.CodeSpec.ExactCode 6 2 3) (g : MainTheory.GlobalClassificationBridge.IntrinsicGroup C),\\n  orderOf g = 5 →\\n    (∃ S gamma,\\n        MainTheory.CubeAction.actFibers gamma\\n              (MainTheory.FiniteOrbitPipeline.fibersOfPair\\n                (MainTheory.OuterCompleteness.recordFiberPair (MainTheory.CodeFiberBridge.recordOf S))) =\\n            (MainTheory.Generated.FiniteOrbitBase.keyAt 34).fibers ∧\\n          MainTheory.Generated.FiniteOrbitBase.paperOrbitId 34 = 36) ∧\\n      (∀ (j : Fin 7), SS.MacWilliams.Aco C.frame.vec ↑j / 4 = MainTheory.WImages.R5A j) ∧\\n        MainTheory.ClassificationLevels.LUEquivalent (MainTheory.ClassificationLevels.CodeProjector.ofFrame C.frame)\\n          (MainTheory.ClassificationLevels.CodeProjector.ofFrame MainTheory.Orbit36LUBridge.canonicalFrame)\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1641},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1608},"severity":"information"}
