{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.OrderFour25CoherenceAlgebra.opposite_anchors\",\"type\":\"∀ (a0 a1 b1 r0 s0 s1 : ℂ),\\n  Complex.normSq a1 = 3 / 16 →\\n    Complex.normSq s0 = 3 / 16 →\\n      r0 ≠ 0 →\\n        Star.star b1 * s1 = Star.star a0 * r0 →\\n          Star.star a1 * r0 + Star.star b1 * s0 = 0 → Star.star s0 * s1 = -(Star.star a0 * a1)\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1641},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1608},"severity":"information"}
