{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.OrderFour25CoordinateMoments.coordinate_values\",\"type\":\"∀ (t : Fin 5 → ℝ) (sigma : ℝ),\\n  MainTheory.OrderFour25Moments.bot t sigma (MainTheory.OrderFour25CoordinateMoments.ai Bool.false) =\\n      3 / 8 - 3 * MainTheory.OrderFour25Moments.total t sigma / 4 + sigma ∧\\n    MainTheory.OrderFour25Moments.bot t sigma (MainTheory.OrderFour25CoordinateMoments.ai Bool.true) =\\n        3 * MainTheory.OrderFour25Moments.total t sigma / 4 - sigma ∧\\n      MainTheory.OrderFour25Moments.up t sigma (MainTheory.OrderFour25CoordinateMoments.si Bool.false) = 3 / 8 - sigma ∧\\n        MainTheory.OrderFour25Moments.up t sigma (MainTheory.OrderFour25CoordinateMoments.si Bool.true) = sigma ∧\\n          ∀ (j : Fin 5),\\n            MainTheory.OrderFour25Moments.bot t sigma (MainTheory.OrderFour25CoordinateMoments.bi Bool.false j) =\\n                1 / 8 - MainTheory.OrderFour25Moments.total t sigma / 4 + t j ∧\\n              MainTheory.OrderFour25Moments.bot t sigma (MainTheory.OrderFour25CoordinateMoments.bi Bool.true j) =\\n                  MainTheory.OrderFour25Moments.total t sigma / 4 - t j ∧\\n                MainTheory.OrderFour25Moments.up t sigma (MainTheory.OrderFour25CoordinateMoments.ri Bool.false j) =\\n                    1 / 8 - t j ∧\\n                  MainTheory.OrderFour25Moments.up t sigma (MainTheory.OrderFour25CoordinateMoments.ri Bool.true j) =\\n                    t j\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1641},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1608},"severity":"information"}
