{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.OrderFour25LiteralNoGo.coherences\",\"type\":\"∀ (c d : SS.State 6 ℂ),\\n  (∀ (b : Bool),\\n      Complex.normSq (c (MainTheory.OrderFour25Support.anchor b)) = 3 / 16 ∧\\n        Complex.normSq (d (MainTheory.OrderFour25Support.full b)) = 3 / 16) →\\n    (∀ (b : Bool) (j : Fin 5),\\n        Complex.normSq (c (MainTheory.OrderFour25Support.hat b j)) = 1 / 16 ∧\\n          Complex.normSq (d (MainTheory.OrderFour25Support.tail b j)) = 1 / 16) →\\n      (∀ x ∉ SixQubit.Orbit25.S0, c x = 0) →\\n        (∀ x ∉ SixQubit.Orbit25.S1, d x = 0) →\\n          SS.HasDistance ![c, d] 3 →\\n            MainTheory.OrderFour25LiteralNoGo.S d = -MainTheory.OrderFour25LiteralNoGo.A c ∧\\n              ∀ (j : Fin 5),\\n                Star.star (d (MainTheory.OrderFour25Support.tail Bool.false j)) *\\n                      d (MainTheory.OrderFour25Support.tail Bool.true j) =\\n                    -MainTheory.OrderFour25LiteralNoGo.A c / 3 ∧\\n                  Star.star (c (MainTheory.OrderFour25Support.hat Bool.false j)) *\\n                      c (MainTheory.OrderFour25Support.hat Bool.true j) =\\n                    -MainTheory.OrderFour25LiteralNoGo.S d / 3\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1641},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1608},"severity":"information"}
