{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.OrderFour25Pinning.branches\",\"type\":\"∀ (t sigma T : ℝ),\\n  T = 5 * t + sigma →\\n    3 / 8 - 3 * T / 4 + sigma = 3 * t →\\n      (3 / 8 - 3 * T / 4 + sigma) * (1 / 8 - t) = (1 / 8 - T / 4 + t) * (3 / 8 - sigma) → (T - 1) * (2 * T - 1) = 0\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":1675},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":1642},"severity":"information"}
