{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.ParityFour.edge_isolation\",\"type\":\"∀ {emb : Fin 4 → Fin 6},\\n  Function.Injective emb →\\n    ∀ (k : Fin 4) (c d : SS.BitString 6 → ℂ) (I : Finset (SS.BitString 6)),\\n      (∀ y ∈ I,\\n          MainTheory.ParityFour.parity\\n              (MainTheory.ParityFour.proj emb\\n                (SS.bxor y (MainTheory.ParityFour.push emb (MainTheory.ParityFour.single k)))) =\\n            Bool.false) →\\n        (∀ (z : MainTheory.ParityFour.Cube),\\n            SS.hammingWt (Function.update z k Bool.false) ≤ 1 →\\n              ∑ y ∈ I,\\n                  SixQubit.signMul (SS.bdot (MainTheory.ParityFour.push emb z) y)\\n                    (Star.star (c (SS.bxor y (MainTheory.ParityFour.push emb (MainTheory.ParityFour.single k)))) *\\n                      d y) =\\n                0) →\\n          MainTheory.ParityFour.overlap emb c d I (MainTheory.ParityFour.push emb (MainTheory.ParityFour.single k)) = 0\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":2185},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":2152},"severity":"information"}
