{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.ParityFour.eq_zero_of_transversal\",\"type\":\"∀ {u : MainTheory.ParityFour.Cube → ℂ},\\n  (∀ (x : MainTheory.ParityFour.Cube), MainTheory.ParityFour.parity x = Bool.true → u x = 0) →\\n    ∀ (T : Set MainTheory.ParityFour.Cube),\\n      (∀ (z : MainTheory.ParityFour.Cube), z ∈ T ∨ SS.bxor z MainTheory.ParityFour.allOnes ∈ T) →\\n        (∀ z ∈ T, ∑ x, ↑(MainTheory.ParityFour.character z x) * u x = 0) → u = 0\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":2185},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":2152},"severity":"information"}
