{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.PauliKernelBTrace.BWeight_cast_eq_sum_trace\",\"type\":\"∀ {n K : ℕ} (F : MainTheory.CodeSpec.OrthonormalFrame n K) (j : ℕ),\\n  ↑(MainTheory.CodeSpec.BWeight F j) =\\n    (∑ P with P.wt = j,\\n        (MainTheory.PauliKernelTrace.pauliKernel P * (MainTheory.ClassificationLevels.CodeProjector.ofFrame F).kernel *\\n              Matrix.conjTranspose (MainTheory.PauliKernelTrace.pauliKernel P) *\\n            (MainTheory.ClassificationLevels.CodeProjector.ofFrame F).kernel).trace) /\\n      ↑K\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":2219},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":2186},"severity":"information"}
