{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.PhaseSectorFull.phaseSectorFull_package\",\"type\":\"∀ {n t : ℕ} {theta : Fin n → ℝ} (D : MainTheory.PhaseSectorFull.SectorDecomposition n t theta),\\n  MainTheory.PhaseSectorFull.ZDetects D →\\n    (∀ (alpha : Fin t) (x : SS.BitString n), 0 ≤ MainTheory.PhaseSectorFull.sectorProbability D alpha x) ∧\\n      (∀ (alpha : Fin t), ∑ x, MainTheory.PhaseSectorFull.sectorProbability D alpha x = 1) ∧\\n        (∀ (alpha : Fin t), (MainTheory.PhaseSectorFull.sectorSupport D alpha).Nonempty) ∧\\n          (∀ (alpha beta : Fin t),\\n              alpha ≠ beta →\\n                Disjoint (MainTheory.PhaseSectorFull.sectorSupport D alpha)\\n                  (MainTheory.PhaseSectorFull.sectorSupport D beta)) ∧\\n            (∀ (alpha : Fin t),\\n                ∀ x ∈ MainTheory.PhaseSectorFull.sectorSupport D alpha,\\n                  ∃ k, MainTheory.RealGate.angle theta x - D.phase alpha = ↑k) ∧\\n              ∃ mu, ∀ (alpha : Fin t) (j : Fin n), MainTheory.PhaseSectorFull.sectorMean D alpha j = mu j\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":2219},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":2186},"severity":"information"}
