{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.PositiveAffineMoments.zero_transfer\",\"type\":\"∀ {n : ℕ} {α : Type u_1} {β : Type u_2} [inst : Fintype α] [inst_1 : Fintype β] (p : α → ℝ) (r : β → ℝ)\\n  (pt : α → Fin n → ℝ) (qt : β → Fin n → ℝ),\\n  (∀ (y : β), 0 < r y) →\\n    (∀ (f : (Fin n → ℝ) →ᵃ[ℝ] ℝ), ∑ x, p x * f (pt x) ^ 2 = ∑ y, r y * f (qt y) ^ 2) →\\n      ∀ (f : (Fin n → ℝ) →ᵃ[ℝ] ℝ), (∀ (x : α), f (pt x) = 0) → ∀ (y : β), f (qt y) = 0\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":2253},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":2220},"severity":"information"}
