{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.PrimitiveOrderTwoCatCompression.compression\",\"type\":\"∀ (p : Orbit2.TensorPauli.Label 5) (j k : Fin 5),\\n  (MainTheory.PrimitiveOrderTwoCatCompression.cats.conjTranspose * Orbit2.TensorPauli.operator p *\\n        MainTheory.PrimitiveOrderTwoCatCompression.cats)\\n      j k =\\n    GaussianInt.toComplex (MainTheory.PrimitiveOrderTwoCatCompression.rawCompression p j k) / 2\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":2287},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":2254},"severity":"information"}
