{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.PrimitiveOrderTwoCatCompression.sum_cats\",\"type\":\"∀ (j : Fin 5) (f : MainTheory.PrimitiveOrderTwoCatCompression.Bits → ℂ),\\n  ∑ s, MainTheory.PrimitiveOrderTwoCatCompression.cats s j * f s =\\n    ↑MainTheory.PrimitiveOrderTwoCatAlgebra.h *\\n      (f (MainTheory.PrimitiveOrderTwoCatCompression.unit j) +\\n        f (MainTheory.PrimitiveOrderTwoCatCompression.complement (MainTheory.PrimitiveOrderTwoCatCompression.unit j)))\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":2287},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":2254},"severity":"information"}
