{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.PrimitiveOrderTwoCatEncoder.lift_compression\",\"type\":\"∀ (A : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℂ)\\n  (B : Matrix MainTheory.PrimitiveOrderTwoCatCompression.Bits MainTheory.PrimitiveOrderTwoCatCompression.Bits ℂ),\\n  MainTheory.PrimitiveOrderTwoCatEncoder.liftCat.conjTranspose * Matrix.kroneckerMap (fun x1 x2 => x1 * x2) A B *\\n      MainTheory.PrimitiveOrderTwoCatEncoder.liftCat =\\n    Matrix.kroneckerMap (fun x1 x2 => x1 * x2) A\\n      (MainTheory.PrimitiveOrderTwoCatCompression.cats.conjTranspose * B *\\n        MainTheory.PrimitiveOrderTwoCatCompression.cats)\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":2287},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":2254},"severity":"information"}
