{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.QuantumRecovery.hermitian_projector_kl_iff_recovery\",\"type\":\"∀ {n K : ℕ} {I : Type u_1} [inst : Fintype I] [DecidableEq I] (F : MainTheory.CodeSpec.OrthonormalFrame n K),\\n  0 < K →\\n    ∀ (E : I → MainTheory.ClassificationLevels.OperatorKernel n),\\n      MainTheory.FiniteKrausChannel.TracePreserving E →\\n        ((∃ c,\\n            c.IsHermitian ∧\\n              ∀ (i j : I),\\n                (MainTheory.ClassificationLevels.CodeProjector.ofFrame F).kernel * Matrix.conjTranspose (E i) * E j *\\n                    (MainTheory.ClassificationLevels.CodeProjector.ofFrame F).kernel =\\n                  c i j • (MainTheory.ClassificationLevels.CodeProjector.ofFrame F).kernel) ↔\\n          ∃ R,\\n            MainTheory.FiniteKrausChannel.TracePreserving R ∧\\n              MainTheory.FiniteKrausChannel.Recovers (MainTheory.PauliKernelBTrace.frameMatrix F) E R)\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":2321},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":2288},"severity":"information"}
