{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.RationalSectionSteps.rational_section_chain\",\"type\":\"∀ {c : Type u_1} [inst : Fintype c] [DecidableEq c] (B G : Matrix c c ℚ),\\n  B * G * B = B →\\n    ∀ (t : c → ℝ) (d : c → ℤ),\\n      ((B.map ⇑(Rat.castHom ℝ)).mulVec t = fun j => ↑(d j)) →\\n        have Br := B.map ⇑(Rat.castHom ℝ);\\n        have Gr := G.map ⇑(Rat.castHom ℝ);\\n        have a := G.num.mulVec d;\\n        (Br.mulVec fun j => ↑(a j) / ↑G.den) = Br.mulVec (Gr.mulVec fun j => ↑(d j)) ∧\\n          Br.mulVec (Gr.mulVec fun j => ↑(d j)) = (Br * Gr * Br).mulVec t ∧ (Br * Gr * Br).mulVec t = Br.mulVec t\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":2321},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":2288},"severity":"information"}
