{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"MainTheory.ZDetection.phaseSectors_of_zDetects\",\"type\":\"∀ {n K d : ℕ} (C : MainTheory.CodeSpec.ExactCode n K d),\\n  MainTheory.ZDetection.ZDetectsFrame C.frame →\\n    ∀ (theta : Fin n → ℝ)\\n      (hpres : MainTheory.CodeSpec.CodePreserving C.frame (MainTheory.PhaseSectorBridge.realGateEnd theta)),\\n      (∀ (alpha : Fin (MainTheory.SectionTwoGeneral.resolutionOf C theta hpres).sectorCount) (x : SS.BitString n),\\n          0 ≤\\n            MainTheory.PhaseSectorFull.sectorProbability\\n              (MainTheory.SectionTwoGeneral.resolutionOf C theta hpres).sectors alpha x) ∧\\n        (∀ (alpha : Fin (MainTheory.SectionTwoGeneral.resolutionOf C theta hpres).sectorCount),\\n            ∑ x,\\n                MainTheory.PhaseSectorFull.sectorProbability\\n                  (MainTheory.SectionTwoGeneral.resolutionOf C theta hpres).sectors alpha x =\\n              1) ∧\\n          (∀ (alpha : Fin (MainTheory.SectionTwoGeneral.resolutionOf C theta hpres).sectorCount),\\n              (MainTheory.PhaseSectorFull.sectorSupport\\n                  (MainTheory.SectionTwoGeneral.resolutionOf C theta hpres).sectors alpha).Nonempty) ∧\\n            (∀ (alpha beta : Fin (MainTheory.SectionTwoGeneral.resolutionOf C theta hpres).sectorCount),\\n                alpha ≠ beta →\\n                  Disjoint\\n                    (MainTheory.PhaseSectorFull.sectorSupport\\n                      (MainTheory.SectionTwoGeneral.resolutionOf C theta hpres).sectors alpha)\\n                    (MainTheory.PhaseSectorFull.sectorSupport\\n                      (MainTheory.SectionTwoGeneral.resolutionOf C theta hpres).sectors beta)) ∧\\n              (∀ (alpha : Fin (MainTheory.SectionTwoGeneral.resolutionOf C theta hpres).sectorCount),\\n                  ∀\\n                    x ∈\\n                      MainTheory.PhaseSectorFull.sectorSupport\\n                        (MainTheory.SectionTwoGeneral.resolutionOf C theta hpres).sectors alpha,\\n                    ∃ k,\\n                      MainTheory.RealGate.angle theta x -\\n                          (MainTheory.SectionTwoGeneral.resolutionOf C theta hpres).sectors.phase alpha =\\n                        ↑k) ∧\\n                ∃ mu,\\n                  ∀ (alpha : Fin (MainTheory.SectionTwoGeneral.resolutionOf C theta hpres).sectorCount) (j : Fin n),\\n                    MainTheory.PhaseSectorFull.sectorMean\\n                        (MainTheory.SectionTwoGeneral.resolutionOf C theta hpres).sectors alpha j =\\n                      mu j\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":2457},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":2424},"severity":"information"}
