{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"Orbit2.Frames.lift_commonJ\",\"type\":\"∀ {α : Type u_1} [inst : Fintype α] [DecidableEq α] (Q : Matrix α Orbit2.Frames.LogicalFrame ℂ),\\n  Q.conjTranspose * Q = 1 →\\n    ∀ (σ : Matrix α α ℂ) (μ : ℂ),\\n      Q.conjTranspose * σ * Q * Orbit2.Frames.J + Orbit2.Frames.J * (Q.conjTranspose * σ * Q).transpose =\\n          (2 * μ) • Orbit2.Frames.J →\\n        Orbit2.Frames.pi Q * σ * Orbit2.Frames.omega Q +\\n            Orbit2.Frames.omega Q * σ.transpose * (Orbit2.Frames.pi Q).transpose =\\n          (2 * μ) • Orbit2.Frames.omega Q\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":2491},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":2458},"severity":"information"}
