{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"QECC.CodeProjector.SectorPhasePivot.difference_constant_on_actualSector\",\"type\":\"∀ {n K q : ℕ} (C : QECC.CodeProjector n K) [inst : NeZero q] (hq : 0 < q) (a : Fin n → ZMod q) (b0 : C.ActiveResidue a)\\n  (S :\\n    QECC.BinaryPivotSolution (C.sectorPhaseSystemWidth a b0) (C.sectorPhaseMatrix a b0) (C.sectorPhaseSystemRHS hq a))\\n  (b : C.ActiveResidue a),\\n  ∀ x ∈ C.actualSectorSupport a b,\\n    QECC.realSupportWeight\\n        ((fun j => ↑(QECC.CodeProjector.SectorPhasePivot.physical C hq a b0 S j)) -\\n          QECC.phaseLift ((QECC.phaseHom n q hq) a))\\n        x =\\n      ↑(QECC.CodeProjector.SectorPhasePivot.sector C hq a b0 S b) - QECC.zmodPhaseLift q hq ↑b\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":2559},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":2526},"severity":"information"}
