{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"QECC.FiberProjectorFamily.projectiveOrder_eq_of_primitive_colors\",\"type\":\"∀ {n q : ℕ} {ι : Type u_1} [inst : Fintype ι] (F : QECC.FiberProjectorFamily n q ι) (hq : 0 < q) (m : ℕ),\\n  2 ≤ m →\\n    ∀ (hmq : m ∣ q) (i0 : ι) (gamma : ι → ZMod m),\\n      (∀ (i : ι), F.residue i = F.residue i0 + (QECC.colorEmbed m q hmq) (gamma i)) →\\n        QECC.ColorPrimitive m gamma →\\n          addOrderOf (F.codeProjector.projectiveClassMap ⟨(QECC.phaseHom n q hq) F.coefficient, ⋯⟩) = m\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":2593},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":2560},"severity":"information"}
