{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"SixQubit.Block33.block_contradiction\",\"type\":\"∀ (p0 p1 p2 p3 p4 p5 q0 q1 q2 q3 q4 q5 s0 s1 s2 s3 s4 s5 t0 t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 : ℂ),\\n  p0 * Star.star p0 + q0 * Star.star q0 = 3 / 10 →\\n    p1 * Star.star p1 + q1 * Star.star q1 = 1 / 5 →\\n      p2 * Star.star p2 + q2 * Star.star q2 = 1 / 5 →\\n        p3 * Star.star p3 + q3 * Star.star q3 = 1 / 10 →\\n          p4 * Star.star p4 + q4 * Star.star q4 = 1 / 10 →\\n            p5 * Star.star p5 + q5 * Star.star q5 = 1 / 10 →\\n              s0 * Star.star s0 + t0 * Star.star t0 = 3 / 10 →\\n                s3 * Star.star s3 + t3 * Star.star t3 = 1 / 10 →\\n                  p0 * Star.star p0 + s0 * Star.star s0 =\\n                      3 / 5 *\\n                        (p0 * Star.star p0 + p1 * Star.star p1 + p2 * Star.star p2 + p3 * Star.star p3 +\\n                            p4 * Star.star p4 +\\n                          p5 * Star.star p5) →\\n                    p0 * Star.star q0 + s0 * Star.star t0 =\\n                        3 / 5 *\\n                          (p0 * Star.star q0 + p1 * Star.star q1 + p2 * Star.star q2 + p3 * Star.star q3 +\\n                              p4 * Star.star q4 +\\n                            p5 * Star.star q5) →\\n                      q0 * Star.star q0 + t0 * Star.star t0 =\\n                          3 / 5 *\\n                            (q0 * Star.star q0 + q1 * Star.star q1 + q2 * Star.star q2 + q3 * Star.star q3 +\\n                                q4 * Star.star q4 +\\n                              q5 * Star.star q5) →\\n                        p3 * Star.star p3 + s3 * Star.star s3 =\\n                            1 / 5 *\\n                              (p0 * Star.star p0 + p1 * Star.star p1 + p2 * Star.star p2 + p3 * Star.star p3 +\\n                                  p4 * Star.star p4 +\\n                                p5 * Star.star p5) →\\n                          p3 * Star.star q3 + s3 * Star.star t3