{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"SixQubit.Flip5.anchor_scale\",\"type\":\"∀ (u v a1 a2 a3 a4 b1 b2 b3 b4 : Fin 4 → ℂ),\\n  SixQubit.Trace5.nsq u = 1 / 3 →\\n    SixQubit.Trace5.nsq v = 1 / 3 →\\n      SixQubit.Trace5.ip u b1 = 0 →\\n        SixQubit.Trace5.ip u b2 = 0 →\\n          SixQubit.Trace5.ip u b3 = 0 →\\n            SixQubit.Trace5.ip u b4 = 0 →\\n              (∀ (k l : Fin 4),\\n                  u k * Star.star (u l) + SixQubit.Trace5.fr a1 a2 a3 a4 k l =\\n                    SixQubit.Trace5.fr b1 b2 b3 b4 k l + v k * Star.star (v l)) →\\n                ∃ sc, (∀ (l : Fin 4), sc * v l = u l) ∧ Star.star sc * sc = 1\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":2661},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":2628},"severity":"information"}
