{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"SixQubit.Kernel5.line\",\"type\":\"∀ (u x : Fin 4 → ℂ),\\n  x 0 * (Star.star (u 0) * u 0 + Star.star (u 2) * u 2) + x 1 * (Star.star (u 1) * u 0 + Star.star (u 3) * u 2) =\\n      (u 0 * Star.star (u 0) + u 1 * Star.star (u 1)) * x 0 + (u 0 * Star.star (u 2) + u 1 * Star.star (u 3)) * x 2 →\\n    x 0 * (Star.star (u 0) * u 1 + Star.star (u 2) * u 3) + x 1 * (Star.star (u 1) * u 1 + Star.star (u 3) * u 3) =\\n        (u 0 * Star.star (u 0) + u 1 * Star.star (u 1)) * x 1 + (u 0 * Star.star (u 2) + u 1 * Star.star (u 3)) * x 3 →\\n      x 2 * (Star.star (u 0) * u 0 + Star.star (u 2) * u 2) + x 3 * (Star.star (u 1) * u 0 + Star.star (u 3) * u 2) =\\n          (u 2 * Star.star (u 0) + u 3 * Star.star (u 1)) * x 0 +\\n            (u 2 * Star.star (u 2) + u 3 * Star.star (u 3)) * x 2 →\\n        x 2 * (Star.star (u 0) * u 1 + Star.star (u 2) * u 3) + x 3 * (Star.star (u 1) * u 1 + Star.star (u 3) * u 3) =\\n            (u 2 * Star.star (u 0) + u 3 * Star.star (u 1)) * x 1 +\\n              (u 2 * Star.star (u 2) + u 3 * Star.star (u 3)) * x 3 →\\n          SixQubit.Trace5.ip u x = 0 →\\n            ↑(SixQubit.Kernel5.Del u) * x 0 = SixQubit.Kernel5.gg u x * SixQubit.Kernel5.WW u 0 ∧\\n              ↑(SixQubit.Kernel5.Del u) * x 1 = SixQubit.Kernel5.gg u x * SixQubit.Kernel5.WW u 1 ∧\\n                ↑(SixQubit.Kernel5.Del u) * x 2 = SixQubit.Kernel5.gg u x * SixQubit.Kernel5.WW u 2 ∧\\n                  ↑(SixQubit.Kernel5.Del u) * x 3 = SixQubit.Kernel5.gg u x * SixQubit.Kernel5.WW u 3\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":2695},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":2662},"severity":"information"}
