{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"SixQubit.Orbit20.blockMatch\",\"type\":\"∀ {p0 p1 p2 p3 q0 q1 q2 q3 : ℝ},\\n  p0 * q1 = p1 * q0 →\\n    p0 * q2 = p2 * q0 →\\n      p0 * q3 = p3 * q0 →\\n        p1 * q2 = p2 * q1 →\\n          p1 * q3 = p3 * q1 →\\n            p2 * q3 = p3 * q2 →\\n              p0 + p1 + p2 + p3 = q0 + q1 + q2 + q3 →\\n                0 ≤ p0 →\\n                  0 ≤ p1 → 0 ≤ p2 → 0 ≤ p3 → 0 ≤ q0 → 0 ≤ q1 → 0 ≤ q2 → 0 ≤ q3 → p0 = q0 ∧ p1 = q1 ∧ p2 = q2 ∧ p3 = q3\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":2763},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":2730},"severity":"information"}
