{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"SixQubit.Orbit20.exA_w0\",\"type\":\"∀ (c d : SS.BitString 6 → ℂ),\\n  SixQubit.Orbit20.offSum c d SixQubit.Orbit20.efA SixQubit.Orbit20.w0 =\\n    Star.star (c SixQubit.Orbit20.y2) * d SixQubit.Orbit20.z0 +\\n                                  Star.star (c SixQubit.Orbit20.y3) * d SixQubit.Orbit20.z1 +\\n                                Star.star (c SixQubit.Orbit20.y0) * d SixQubit.Orbit20.z2 +\\n                              Star.star (c SixQubit.Orbit20.y1) * d SixQubit.Orbit20.z3 +\\n                            Star.star (c SixQubit.Orbit20.y6) * d SixQubit.Orbit20.z4 +\\n                          Star.star (c SixQubit.Orbit20.y7) * d SixQubit.Orbit20.z5 +\\n                        Star.star (c SixQubit.Orbit20.y4) * d SixQubit.Orbit20.z6 +\\n                      Star.star (c SixQubit.Orbit20.y5) * d SixQubit.Orbit20.z7 +\\n                    Star.star (c SixQubit.Orbit20.y10) * d SixQubit.Orbit20.z8 +\\n                  Star.star (c SixQubit.Orbit20.y11) * d SixQubit.Orbit20.z9 +\\n                Star.star (c SixQubit.Orbit20.y8) * d SixQubit.Orbit20.z10 +\\n              Star.star (c SixQubit.Orbit20.y9) * d SixQubit.Orbit20.z11 +\\n            Star.star (c SixQubit.Orbit20.y14) * d SixQubit.Orbit20.z12 +\\n          Star.star (c SixQubit.Orbit20.y15) * d SixQubit.Orbit20.z13 +\\n        Star.star (c SixQubit.Orbit20.y12) * d SixQubit.Orbit20.z14 +\\n      Star.star (c SixQubit.Orbit20.y13) * d SixQubit.Orbit20.z15\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":2763},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":2730},"severity":"information"}
