{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"SixQubit.Orbit26.sandwich\",\"type\":\"∀ (v1 v2 g1 g2 g3 g4 h1 h2 h3 h4 a0 a1 a2 a3 a4 a5 a6 a7 b0 b1 b2 b3 b4 b5 b6 b7 : ℂ),\\n  g1 * Star.star g1 + h1 * Star.star h1 + g3 * Star.star g3 + h3 * Star.star h3 =\\n      1 / 2 *\\n        (a0 * Star.star a0 + a1 * Star.star a1 + a2 * Star.star a2 + a3 * Star.star a3 + a4 * Star.star a4 +\\n              a5 * Star.star a5 +\\n            a6 * Star.star a6 +\\n          a7 * Star.star a7) →\\n    g1 * Star.star g2 + h1 * Star.star h2 + g3 * Star.star g4 + h3 * Star.star h4 =\\n        1 / 2 *\\n          (a0 * Star.star b0 + a1 * Star.star b1 + a2 * Star.star b2 + a3 * Star.star b3 + a4 * Star.star b4 +\\n                a5 * Star.star b5 +\\n              a6 * Star.star b6 +\\n            a7 * Star.star b7) →\\n      g2 * Star.star g1 + h2 * Star.star h1 + g4 * Star.star g3 + h4 * Star.star h3 =\\n          1 / 2 *\\n            (b0 * Star.star a0 + b1 * Star.star a1 + b2 * Star.star a2 + b3 * Star.star a3 + b4 * Star.star a4 +\\n                  b5 * Star.star a5 +\\n                b6 * Star.star a6 +\\n              b7 * Star.star a7) →\\n        g2 * Star.star g2 + h2 * Star.star h2 + g4 * Star.star g4 + h4 * Star.star h4 =\\n            1 / 2 *\\n              (b0 * Star.star b0 + b1 * Star.star b1 + b2 * Star.star b2 + b3 * Star.star b3 + b4 * Star.star b4 +\\n                    b5 * Star.star b5 +\\n                  b6 * Star.star b6 +\\n                b7 * Star.star b7) →\\n          Complex.normSq (SixQubit.Block26.ip v1 v2 g1 g2) + Complex.normSq (SixQubit.Block26.ip v1 v2 h1 h2) +\\n                Complex.normSq (SixQubit.Block26.ip v1 v2 g3 g4) +\\n              Complex.normSq (SixQubit.Block26.ip v1 v2 h3 h4) =\\n            1 / 2 *\\n              (Complex.normSq (SixQubit.Block26.ip v1 v2 a0 b0) + Complex.normSq (SixQubit.Block26.ip v1 v2 a1 b1) +\\n                          Complex.normSq (SixQubit.Block26.ip v1 v2 a2 b2) +\\n