{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"SixQubit.Orbit31.branch_quad\",\"type\":\"∀ (b10 b11 b12 b13 b20 b21 b22 b23 b30 b31 b32 b33 : ℂ) (al0 al1 al2 : ℝ),\\n  0 ≤ al0 →\\n    0 ≤ al1 →\\n      0 ≤ al2 →\\n        Complex.normSq b10 + Complex.normSq b11 + Complex.normSq b12 + Complex.normSq b13 = 1 / 4 →\\n          Complex.normSq b20 + Complex.normSq b21 + Complex.normSq b22 + Complex.normSq b23 = 1 / 4 →\\n            Complex.normSq b10 + Complex.normSq b20 + Complex.normSq b30 = al0 + 1 / 8 →\\n              Complex.normSq b11 + Complex.normSq b21 + Complex.normSq b31 = al1 + 1 / 8 →\\n                Complex.normSq b12 + Complex.normSq b22 + Complex.normSq b32 = al2 + 1 / 8 →\\n                  b10 * b21 + b11 * b20 = 0 →\\n                    b10 * b22 + b12 * b20 = 0 →\\n                      b10 * b23 + b13 * b20 = 0 →\\n                        b11 * b22 + b12 * b21 = 0 →\\n                          b11 * b23 + b13 * b21 = 0 →\\n                            b12 * b23 + b13 * b22 = 0 →\\n                              b10 * b31 + b11 * b30 = 0 →\\n                                b10 * b32 + b12 * b30 = 0 →\\n                                  b11 * b32 + b12 * b31 = 0 →\\n                                    b11 * b33 + b13 * b31 = 0 →\\n                                      b12 * b33 + b13 * b32 = 0 →\\n                                        b20 * b31 + b21 * b30 = 0 →\\n                                          b20 * b32 + b22 * b30 = 0 → b20 * b33 + b23 * b30 = 0 → False\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":2899},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":2866},"severity":"information"}
