{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"SixQubit.Orbit32.local_nogo\",\"type\":\"∀ (au bu cu eu fu gu : ℂ) (Au Bu Cu Eu Fu Gu : ℝ),\\n  Au = Complex.normSq au →\\n    Bu = Complex.normSq bu →\\n      Cu = Complex.normSq cu →\\n        Eu = Complex.normSq eu →\\n          Fu = Complex.normSq fu →\\n            Gu = Complex.normSq gu →\\n              Au = (2 * Eu + 2 * Fu - Gu) / 3 →\\n                Cu = (-Eu + 2 * Fu + 2 * Gu) / 3 →\\n                  Bu = (2 * Eu - Fu + 2 * Gu) / 3 →\\n                    0 < Eu →\\n                      Star.star au * fu + Star.star bu * gu = 0 →\\n                        Star.star au * eu + Star.star cu * gu = 0 → Star.star bu * eu + Star.star cu * fu = 0 → False\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":3001},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":2968},"severity":"information"}
