{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"SixQubit.Orbit36.scales_forced\",\"type\":\"∀ {s1 s2 s3 s4 p1 p2 p3 p4 : ℝ},\\n  0 < s1 →\\n    0 < s2 →\\n      0 < s3 →\\n        0 < s4 →\\n          s1 * s2 + s1 * s3 + s1 * s4 = p1 + 1 / 10 →\\n            s1 * s2 + s2 * s3 + s2 * s4 = p2 + 1 / 10 →\\n              s1 * s3 + s2 * s3 + s3 * s4 = p3 + 1 / 10 →\\n                s1 * s4 + s2 * s4 + s3 * s4 = p4 + 1 / 10 →\\n                  s1 * s2 + s1 * s3 + s1 * s4 + s2 * s3 + s2 * s4 + s3 * s4 = 2 / 5 →\\n                    s2 * s3 * (s2 * s4) * p2 = s1 * s2 * (s3 * s4) * p1 →\\n                      s2 * s3 * (s3 * s4) * p3 = s1 * s3 * (s2 * s4) * p1 →\\n                        s2 * s4 * (s3 * s4) * p4 = s1 * s4 * (s2 * s3) * p1 →\\n                          s1 = s2 ∧\\n                            s1 = s3 ∧ s1 = s4 ∧ s1 * s1 = 1 / 15 ∧ p1 = 1 / 10 ∧ p2 = 1 / 10 ∧ p3 = 1 / 10 ∧ p4 = 1 / 10\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":3069},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":3036},"severity":"information"}
