{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"SixQubit.Orbit44.no_go_of_moments\",\"type\":\"∀ (c d : SS.BitString 6 → ℂ),\\n  SixQubit.Orbit44.MomentSystem (Complex.normSq (c SixQubit.Orbit44.y0)) (Complex.normSq (c SixQubit.Orbit44.y1))\\n      (Complex.normSq (c SixQubit.Orbit44.y2)) (Complex.normSq (c SixQubit.Orbit44.y3))\\n      (Complex.normSq (c SixQubit.Orbit44.y4)) (Complex.normSq (c SixQubit.Orbit44.y5))\\n      (Complex.normSq (c SixQubit.Orbit44.y6)) (Complex.normSq (c SixQubit.Orbit44.y7))\\n      (Complex.normSq (c SixQubit.Orbit44.y8)) (Complex.normSq (c SixQubit.Orbit44.y9))\\n      (Complex.normSq (d SixQubit.Orbit44.z0)) (Complex.normSq (d SixQubit.Orbit44.z1))\\n      (Complex.normSq (d SixQubit.Orbit44.z2)) (Complex.normSq (d SixQubit.Orbit44.z3))\\n      (Complex.normSq (d SixQubit.Orbit44.z4)) (Complex.normSq (d SixQubit.Orbit44.z5))\\n      (Complex.normSq (d SixQubit.Orbit44.z6)) (Complex.normSq (d SixQubit.Orbit44.z7))\\n      (Complex.normSq (d SixQubit.Orbit44.z8)) (Complex.normSq (d SixQubit.Orbit44.z9)) →\\n    SixQubit.Orbit44.offSum c d SixQubit.Orbit44.ef SixQubit.Orbit44.w0 = 0 →\\n      SixQubit.Orbit44.offSum c d SixQubit.Orbit44.ef SixQubit.Orbit44.w1 = 0 →\\n        SixQubit.Orbit44.offSum c d SixQubit.Orbit44.ef SixQubit.Orbit44.w2 = 0 →\\n          SixQubit.Orbit44.offSum c d SixQubit.Orbit44.ef SixQubit.Orbit44.w3 = 0 →\\n            SixQubit.Orbit44.offSum c d SixQubit.Orbit44.ef SixQubit.Orbit44.w4 = 0 →\\n              SixQubit.Orbit44.offSum c d SixQubit.Orbit44.ef SixQubit.Orbit44.w5 = 0 →\\n                SixQubit.Orbit44.offSum c d SixQubit.Orbit44.ef SixQubit.Orbit44.w6 = 0 →\\n                  SixQubit.Orbit44.offSum c d SixQubit.Orbit44.ef SixQubit.Orbit44.w7 = 0 →\\n                    SixQubit.Orbit44.offSum c d SixQubit.Orbit44.ef SixQubit.Orbit44.w8 = 0 →\\n                      SixQubit.Orbit44.offSum c d SixQubit.Orbit44.ef SixQubit.Orbit44.w9 = 0 → False\"}","endPos":{"column":1,