{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"SixQubit.Orbit45A2.Aco_two_value\",\"type\":\"∀ (c d : SS.BitString 6 → ℂ) (g1 g2 g3 : ℝ),\\n  (∀ x ∉ SixQubit.Orbit45Support.S0, c x = 0) →\\n    (∀ y ∉ SixQubit.Orbit45Support.S1, d y = 0) →\\n      SS.HasDistance ![c, d] 3 →\\n        SixQubit.Orbit45Universal.BlockMasses c d g1 g2 g3 →\\n          SixQubit.Orbit45Phase.PhaseRelations c d → SS.MacWilliams.Aco ![c, d] 2 = 8 * (g1 ^ 2 + g2 ^ 2 + g3 ^ 2)\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":3239},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":3206},"severity":"information"}
