{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"SixQubit.Orbit8Universal.compHaf_sum\",\"type\":\"∀ (c d : SS.BitString 6 → ℂ),\\n  (∀ (x : SS.BitString 6), SS.weight SixQubit.Orbit8Universal.av x ≠ 0 → c x = 0) →\\n    (∀ (x : SS.BitString 6), SS.weight SixQubit.Orbit8Universal.av x ≠ 1 → d x = 0) →\\n      SS.innerC c c = 1 →\\n        SS.innerC d d = 1 →\\n          SS.HasDistance ![c, d] 3 →\\n            ∀ (i j : Fin 6),\\n              i ≠ j →\\n                (∑ m,\\n                    if m ≠ i ∧ m ≠ j then\\n                      SixQubit.Orbit8Universal.u d m * Star.star (SixQubit.Orbit8Universal.compHaf d i m)\\n                    else 0) =\\n                  0\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":3443},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":3410},"severity":"information"}
