{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"SixQubit.Orbit9Universal.inner_hop01_S0\",\"type\":\"∀ (c : SS.State 6 ℂ),\\n  (∀ x ∉ SixQubit.Orbit9Universal.S0, c x = 0) →\\n    SS.innerC c (SixQubit.Orbit8Universal.hop 0 1 c) =\\n      Star.star (SixQubit.Orbit9Universal.xamp c 0) * SixQubit.Orbit9Universal.xamp c 1 +\\n              Star.star (SixQubit.Orbit9Universal.damp c 1 2) * SixQubit.Orbit9Universal.damp c 0 2 +\\n            Star.star (SixQubit.Orbit9Universal.damp c 1 3) * SixQubit.Orbit9Universal.damp c 0 3 +\\n          Star.star (SixQubit.Orbit9Universal.damp c 1 4) * SixQubit.Orbit9Universal.damp c 0 4 +\\n        Star.star (SixQubit.Orbit9Universal.damp c 1 5) * SixQubit.Orbit9Universal.damp c 0 5\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":3477},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":3444},"severity":"information"}
