{"caption":"","data":"CERTIFICATION_TYPE {\"kind\":\"theorem\",\"name\":\"SixQubit.Trace5.lagrange_real\",\"type\":\"∀ (x y : Fin 4 → ℂ),\\n  SixQubit.Trace5.nsq x * SixQubit.Trace5.nsq y - Complex.normSq (SixQubit.Trace5.ip x y) =\\n    Complex.normSq (x 0 * y 1 - x 1 * y 0) + Complex.normSq (x 0 * y 2 - x 2 * y 0) +\\n            Complex.normSq (x 0 * y 3 - x 3 * y 0) +\\n          Complex.normSq (x 1 * y 2 - x 2 * y 1) +\\n        Complex.normSq (x 1 * y 3 - x 3 * y 1) +\\n      Complex.normSq (x 2 * y 3 - x 3 * y 2)\"}","endPos":{"column":1,"line":3477},"fileName":"artifacts\\manuscript-certification-20261005\\kernel-types-orbit45-algebra.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":3444},"severity":"information"}
